# Secret patterns scanned against the staged diff (grep -E, one per line).
# Add more patterns here as needed; keep them specific to avoid false positives.

# Bilibili login cookies / tokens
# Each cookie key tolerates optional whitespace and an optional wrapping
# quote before the value (e.g. `SESSDATA="..."`), while still checking the
# real value format. An empty assignment (`SESSDATA=`) is NOT flagged.
SESSDATA=[[:space:]]*["']?[A-Za-z0-9%]
bili_jct=[[:space:]]*["']?[a-f0-9]{32}
buvid3=[[:space:]]*["']?[A-Z0-9-]{8}
DedeUserID=[[:space:]]*["']?[0-9]{4,}
bili_ticket=[[:space:]]*["']?[A-Za-z0-9_.-]{20,}

# Generic API keys / secrets
sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}
LLM_API_KEY=[^[:space:]"']
password[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*[^[:space:]"']
secret[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*[^[:space:]"']
